<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2376] .NET: UnmanagedUtils.IgnitionStart return value is never used</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2376</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;UnmanagedUtils.IgnitionStart is used only once, and return value is not used.&lt;br/&gt;
Quick test to make it void resulted in OutOfMemory in tests on TC.&lt;br/&gt;
Need to investigate what is going on.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
